cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use solmaps or its data in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "solmaps: transfer maps and route engine for the solar system"
abstract: >
  solmaps computes what it costs to travel between places in the solar system on any day until 2100: daily transfer
  alternatives between 30 bodies with flights up to 100 years, flyby routes, low-thrust transfers, station siting and
  chronological journeys for ships with fuel, payload and refuelling. It is the open map and route engine of
  Deep Space Strategy.
license: MIT
